        "@value": "3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-5beta-cholestan-27-al [mitochondrial matrix] + NADPH [mitochondrial matrix] + O2 [mitochondrial matrix] + H+ [mitochondrial matrix] => NADP+ [mitochondrial matrix] + H2O [mitochondrial matrix] + THCA [mitochondrial matrix]"
