        "@value": "NADP+ [mitochondrial matrix] + 5beta-cholestan-3alpha,7alpha,26-triol [mitochondrial matrix] => NADPH [mitochondrial matrix] + 3alpha,7alpha-dihydroxy-5beta-cholestan-26-al [mitochondrial matrix] + H+ [mitochondrial matrix]"
