eMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-192189\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-192189.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"consumedByEvent\": [10356061], \"dbId\": 29360, \"displayName\": \"NAD+ [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NAD+\", \"NAD(1-)\", \"NAD\", \"NAD(+)\", \"Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide\", \"DPN\", \"Diphosphopyridine nucleotide\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29360\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29360.6\"}], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Cholest-5-ene-3beta,7alpha,24(S)-triol is oxidized and isomerized to 4-cholesten-7alpha,24(S)-diol-3-one\", \"(24S)-7alpha-dihydroxycholesterol + NAD(+) => (24S)-7alpha,24-dihydroxycholest-4-en-3-one + H(+) + NADH\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 193724, \"displayName\": \"4CHOL7a,24(S)DONE [endoplasmic reticulum membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"4CHOL7a,24(S)DONE\", \"(24S)-7alpha,24-dihydroxycholest-4-en-3-one\", \"4-cholesten-7alpha,24(S)-diol-3-one\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10356061], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-193724\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-193724.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 73473, \"displayName\": \"NADH [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NADH\", \"NADH(2-)\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10356061], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-73473\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-73473.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 70106, \"displayName\": \"H+ [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H+\", \"hydron\", \"proton\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10356061], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-70106\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-70106.5\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10355595, \"displayName\": \"CYP39A1 7-hydroxylates 24OH-CHOL\", \"followingEvent\": [10356061], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CYP39A1 7-hydroxylates 24OH-CHOL\", \"(24S)-hydroxycholesterol + O2 + reduced (NADPH--hemoprotein reductase) => (24S)-7alpha-dihydroxycholesterol + H(+) + H2O + oxidized (NADPH--hemoprotein reductase)\", \"24-hydroxycholesterol is 7alpha-hydroxylated to yield cholest-5-ene-3beta,7alpha,24-triol\", \"24-hydroxycholesterol + NADPH + H+ + O2 => cholest-5-ene-3beta,7alpha,24-triol + NADP+ + H2O\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Bos taurus\", \"stId\": \"R-BTA-192178\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-BTA-192178.1\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"BTA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48898, \"displayName\": \"Bos taurus\", \"name\": [\"Bos taurus\", \"B. taurus\", \"Bt\", \"bovine\", \"cattle\", \"cow\", \"domestic cattle\", \"domestic cow\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9913\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Bos taurus\", \"stId\": \"R-BTA-193789\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-BTA-193789.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a>