umen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PALM\", \"hexadecanoate\", \"palmitate\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10413939], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-5690516\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-5690516.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 1678675, \"displayName\": \"CoA-SH [lysosomal lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CoA-SH\", \"coenzyme A(4-)\", \"coenzyme A\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10413939], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-1678675\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-1678675.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 428040, \"displayName\": \"H+ [lysosomal lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H+\", \"hydron\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10413939], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-428040\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-428040.3\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"BTA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48898, \"displayName\": \"Bos taurus\", \"name\": [\"Bos taurus\", \"B. taurus\", \"Bt\", \"bovine\", \"cattle\", \"cow\", \"domestic cattle\", \"domestic cow\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9913\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Bos taurus\", \"stId\": \"R-BTA-5690046\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-BTA-5690046.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these even