        "@value": "LAU-CoA [mitochondrial matrix] + FAD [mitochondrial matrix] + H+ [mitochondrial matrix] => FADH2 [mitochondrial matrix] + 2-trans-Dodecenoyl-CoA [mitochondrial matrix]"
