        "@value": "25(S) THCA-CoA is dehydrogenated to 3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-5beta-cholest-24-enoyl-CoA (THCA-CoA)"
      }
    ],
    "https://systemomicslab.github.io/MSLipidMapper/ontology/curationStatus": [
