X12/15\", \"(5Z,8Z,11Z,14Z)-eicosatetraenoate + O2 => (12S)-hydroperoxy-(5Z,8Z,10E,14Z)-eicosatetraenoate\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 2142811, \"displayName\": \"12S-HpETE [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"12S-HpETE\", \"12(S)-HPETE(1-)\", \"12(S)-HPETE\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10393599], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-2142811\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-2142811.4\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"BTA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48898, \"displayName\": \"Bos taurus\", \"name\": [\"Bos taurus\", \"B. taurus\", \"Bt\", \"bovine\", \"cattle\", \"cow\", \"domestic cattle\", \"domestic cow\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9913\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Bos taurus\", \"stId\": \"R-BTA-2161964\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-BTA-2161964.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER